          <div class="faq-wrapper">
            <div class="left_side-faq">
              <div class="header-faq">
                <div class="text_heading-faq">
                  <div class="text-12-caps opacity-60 center-small">Frequently asked questions</div>
                  <div class="max-w-400">
                    <h2 class="h2 center-small"><span class="span">Got questions?</span> <br>We&#x27;ve got answers</h2>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80 center-small">We want to make sure you feel confident that our service is right for you. Here we’ve looked to address some commonly asked questions. If you have any more specific questions, don’t hesitate to get in touch with a member of the team.</p>
              </div><img src="/images/Frame-1707478606_4.avif" loading="lazy" alt="An abstract digital interface featuring a dark theme with various input fields, a progress bar, and a question mark icon, suggesting a user-friendly design for a software application." class="image-faq">
            </div>
            <div class="right_side-faq">
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="ac099417-844f-32a1-3b03-adffa1c7a186" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">How long does a video production take?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="ac099417-844f-32a1-3b03-adffa1c7a18a" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">The optimal length for product videos is 30 seconds to 2 minutes. But generally speaking, the length of video depends on each use case, industry, and the stage of the sales funnel.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="ac099417-844f-32a1-3b03-adffa1c7a192" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">How much does a product video cost?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="ac099417-844f-32a1-3b03-adffa1c7a196" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">
                      <a href="https://www.motiontheagency.com/blog/explainer-video-cost-what-drives-the-price"><span class="text-span-2">Cost of a product video</span></a><span> </span>is determined by many factors; the length of your video, its complexity, style of  animation, number of characters and objects and the level of details. Longer videos are going to be more expensive than short ones. Video with a complex storyline will cost significantly more than an explainer video.<br><br>To receive the exact cost breakdown, feel free to reach out to us and we will discuss the specifications of your project in detail.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="ac099417-844f-32a1-3b03-adffa1c7a19b" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Do you support multiple aspect ratios?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="ac099417-844f-32a1-3b03-adffa1c7a19f" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Yes, we do support multiple aspect ratios reformatting, but there would be an additional charge as outlined on our pricing page.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="ac099417-844f-32a1-3b03-adffa1c7a1a4" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">I am still not sure if this is right for me, can we discuss it first?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="ac099417-844f-32a1-3b03-adffa1c7a1a8" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Yes absolutely. Feel free to book a consultation to discuss your project further. We will contact you to set up the ideal time and more than happy to answer your questions.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="ac099417-844f-32a1-3b03-adffa1c7a1ad" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">What is a product animation video?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="ac099417-844f-32a1-3b03-adffa1c7a1b1" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">An animated product video is a powerful marketing tool that uses vibrant visuals and engaging storytelling to showcase the features and benefits of a product. Unlike traditional product videos that rely on live-action footage, an animated product video allows you to create a more dynamic and immersive experience that can capture the attention of your target audience and increase brand awareness.<br><br>Animated product videos typically start with a script that outlines the key messages and benefits you want to communicate. From there, a team of animators will create custom visuals that bring your product to life. These visuals can include both 2D Animations and 3D Animations. Learn more about these services here: <strong>2D Animators For Hire</strong> and <strong>3D Animators For Hire</strong>.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="ac099417-844f-32a1-3b03-adffa1c7a1bb" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">What is an animated product video, and how can it benefit my business?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="ac099417-844f-32a1-3b03-adffa1c7a1bf" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Animated product videos can benefit your business in several ways. First and foremost, they can increase brand awareness and help you stand out in a crowded market. By creating a unique and memorable video, you can capture the attention of potential customers and create a lasting impression.<br><br>Additionally, animated product videos can simplify complex ideas and communicate your message more effectively. You can help your audience understand your product or service and its benefits by breaking down complicated concepts into easily digestible visuals and animations.<br><br>Animated product videos can also increase conversions and sales. By showcasing your product or service in an engaging and compelling way, you can create a desire for your offering and encourage viewers to take action.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="ac099417-844f-32a1-3b03-adffa1c7a1cb" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">How can animated videos of my products and services enhance my marketing campaigns?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="ac099417-844f-32a1-3b03-adffa1c7a1cf" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Animated product videos are an invaluable marketing asset that can revolutionize the way you communicate with your audience. They are a powerful tool for simplifying complex ideas and presenting your message in a clear and concise way. By leveraging the use of visual aids and captivating animations, you can effectively break down complicated concepts, resulting in improved comprehension and engagement from your viewers. The simplified message presented in these videos can help your audience to understand the value of your product or service, ultimately leading to increased conversions and sales.<br><br>Furthermore, animated product videos can be quickly and easily shared on social media platforms and other online channels, creating motion graphics for social media content and animating your products and services can significantly expand its reach and exposure. The viral effect created by sharing these videos can generate buzz and excitement around your brand, resulting in heightened awareness and increased demand for your offerings. By incorporating animated product videos into your marketing strategy, you can establish your business as a market leader, foster greater audience engagement, and ultimately drive more significant revenue growth.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="e4a422fe-96f7-ca44-3872-6e2aaf416183" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">What software is used for 3D animation?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="e4a422fe-96f7-ca44-3872-6e2aaf416187" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">There are several software programs used for 3D animation, each with its unique features and capabilities. Some of the software programs used at our Motion Graphics Agency include Blender and Cinema 4D.<br>‍<br>By using advanced 3D animation techniques, you can create lifelike animations that better showcase your products or services, making them more attractive to potential customers.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
